","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ws2650517-yi","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p004","quote":"顒本以乂弱冏強，冀乂為冏所擒，然後以乂為辭，宣告四方共討之，因廢帝立成都王，己為宰相，專制天下。即而乂殺冏，其計不果，乃潛使侍中馮蓀、河南尹李含、中書令卞粹等襲乂。乂並誅之。顒遂與穎同伐京都。穎遣刺客圖乂，時長沙國左常侍王矩侍直，見客色動，遂殺之。詔以乂為大都督以距顒。連戰自八月至十月，朝議以乂、穎兄弟，可以辭說而釋，乃使中書令王衍行太尉，光祿勳石陋行司徒，使說穎，令與乂分陝而居，穎不從。乂因致書於穎曰：","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p004:m0056"}],"interpretation_note":"僅本篇明載死亡；不以沒于作死亡，不從報齡倒生年。無可綁年者留null。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yi:p004:m0064","surface":"馮蓀","start":64,"end":66,"person_id":"smp_h5w_l0i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yi:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p004:m0020","surface":"馮蓀","start":20,"end":22,"person_id":"smp_h5w_l0i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p003:m0106","surface":"馮蓀","start":106,"end":108,"person_id":"smp_h5w_l0i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p004:m0056","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"馮蓀","kind":"person","person_id":"smp_h5w_l0i","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p008:m0116","surface":"馮蓀","start":116,"end":118,"person_id":"smp_h5w_l0i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yi:p004